## Layout

Clean Architecture packages under `src/`:

- `domain/` — pure business concepts (no Django imports)
- `application/` — use cases and persistence ports
- `infrastructure/persistence/` — Django ORM models and migrations
- `presentation/api/` — DRF views and URL routes
- `config/` — Django project settings / ASGI / WSGI

Dependency rule: `presentation` → `application` → `domain`;
Django ORM stays in `infrastructure`.
